antity to ensure enough stock is available\", \"default\": 1}}, \"required\": [\"similar_products\"]}}, {\"name\": \"snapshot_workspace_and_alert\", \"description\": \"Create a backup of a workspace and notify a target user.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"workspace_path\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Workspace path to backup\"}, \"backup_name\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Backup name\", \"default\": \"\"}, \"user_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"User identifier to notify\", \"default\": \"default_user\"}, \"priority\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Notification priority\", \"enum\": [\"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"], \"default\": \"medium\"}, \"channel\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Notification channel\", \"enum\": [\"app\", \"sms\", \"email\"], \"default\": \"app\"}}, \"required\": [\"workspace_path\"]}}]\n\nUser request:\nPlease search the electronics category with the query headphones and add 1 black Sony XM5 (target product ID: p_sony_xm5_blk) to my cart. After that, check for trending alternatives for it. From the recommendations, please select the silver Sony WH-1000XM5 instead, hold its inventory, and confirm the order using my credit_card. My account ID is user_123. Once that's done, create a document titled \"Substitute Order Confirmation\" with all the order details. Finally, snapshot the /workspace/shopping_records workspace and send me an alert.\n\nBegin execution:\n<action>\n"
